          "githubAnchor": "2-per-role-packets-pass-on-the-letter-with-two-condensation-losses",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9b9a38117196"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "3. Executor roster — accurate on paper, unusable in practice",
