          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH-1 — `cohort-planner.mjs`'s actor-keyed operation resolver is *already* broken by this fixture's shape; this cell's Gaps section names the adjacent `activation` gap but not this concrete, already-live landmine",
          "anchor": "high-1-cohort-plannermjss-actor-keyed-operation-resolver-is-already-broken-by-this-fixtures-shape-this-cells-gaps-section-names-the-adjacent-activation-gap-but-not-this-concrete-already-live-landmine",
