          "text": "Smallest fix",
          "anchor": "smallest-fix",
          "githubAnchor": "smallest-fix",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9295fa443f12"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 2 — raw-store-door forgery through the new gate: **BROKE as disclosed, plus an ignored cheap signal (MEDIUM)**",
          "anchor": "attack-2-raw-store-door-forgery-through-the-new-gate-broke-as-disclosed-plus-an-ignored-cheap-signal-medium",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-2-raw-store-door-forgery-through-the-new-gate-broke-as-disclosed-plus-an-ignored-cheap-signal-medium",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4350b0f67e52"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "The cheap signals a real validation leaves that nothing checks",
          "anchor": "the-cheap-signals-a-real-validation-leaves-that-nothing-checks",
          "githubAnchor": "the-cheap-signals-a-real-validation-leaves-that-nothing-checks",
          "stableAnchor": "h-61f84fadc48f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 3 — `show.mjs` render: **HELD**",
          "anchor": "attack-3-showmjs-render-held",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-3-showmjs-render-held",
          "stableAnchor": "h-52f49430eb0a"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 4 — P09.1's schema-only boundary: **HELD**",
          "anchor": "attack-4-p091s-schema-only-boundary-held",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-4-p091s-schema-only-boundary-held",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4bd7631cf735"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 5 — P09.1's cross-referential checks: **MOSTLY HELD, two real gaps**",
