          "stableAnchor": "h-11cf4c0a1319"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Gap 1 (fgOS: `gates[id]` has no actor/role) — beehive: `source` field, live and rich",
          "anchor": "gap-1-fgos-gatesid-has-no-actorrole-beehive-source-field-live-and-rich",
          "githubAnchor": "gap-1-fgos-gatesid-has-no-actorrole-beehive-source-field-live-and-rich",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2fb9fbdcf4f8"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Gap 4 (fgOS: no rejected-alternatives capture anywhere) — beehive: `alternatives` field, populated 64/701 times",
