          "githubAnchor": "gap-3-fgos-contextmd-unenforced-beehive-mandatory-gate-1-unattended-equivalent",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8d113e1bdafd"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Gap 2 (fgOS: `judgeDecompose` captures nothing) — no direct beehive field to copy, but a clear principle",
