          "githubAnchor": "28-metadata-extension-point-và-bài-học-typing",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ffd8ac4e512d"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "2.9 `external_ref` / `source_repo` / `source_repo_path` — identity xuyên hệ",
