          "githubAnchor": "bug-2-no-guidance-on-how-to-wait-for-a-backgrounded-run",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2f07f3699ff0"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Bug 3 (discovered live, not anticipated): the backgrounded process can itself die mid-run, orphaning claims",
          "anchor": "bug-3-discovered-live-not-anticipated-the-backgrounded-process-can-itself-die-mid-run-orphaning-claims",
          "githubAnchor": "bug-3-discovered-live-not-anticipated-the-backgrounded-process-can-itself-die-mid-run-orphaning-claims",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2f0ad296b0cd"
