      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Watching an agent work in a real pane, without letting the next dispatch talk to a stranger's session",
          "anchor": "watching-an-agent-work-in-a-real-pane-without-letting-the-next-dispatch-talk-to-a-strangers-session",
          "githubAnchor": "watching-an-agent-work-in-a-real-pane-without-letting-the-next-dispatch-talk-to-a-strangers-session",
          "stableAnchor": "h-7d9bb44e7c9b"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What shipped",
          "anchor": "what-shipped",
          "githubAnchor": "what-shipped",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2cc9e713e964"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The hard constraint that made this safe",
          "anchor": "the-hard-constraint-that-made-this-safe",
          "githubAnchor": "the-hard-constraint-that-made-this-safe",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f9ebc1b670ae"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The other locked constraint this item still had to satisfy",
          "anchor": "the-other-locked-constraint-this-item-still-had-to-satisfy",
          "githubAnchor": "the-other-locked-constraint-this-item-still-had-to-satisfy",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9d76a8f7af44"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Landing note",
          "anchor": "landing-note",
          "githubAnchor": "landing-note",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ddc3f496f9c3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Generalizing beyond the first target CLI (`tsk-5jl`)",
          "anchor": "generalizing-beyond-the-first-target-cli-tsk-5jl",
          "githubAnchor": "generalizing-beyond-the-first-target-cli-tsk-5jl",
          "stableAnchor": "h-69ac1324b296"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the config wiring had to land as a separate hand-edit commit on main (`tsk-2ii`)",
          "anchor": "why-the-config-wiring-had-to-land-as-a-separate-hand-edit-commit-on-main-tsk-2ii",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-config-wiring-had-to-land-as-a-separate-hand-edit-commit-on-main-tsk-2ii",
          "stableAnchor": "h-526050f77ab9"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A second, opt-in completion-detection mode for real interactive TUIs (`tsk-10j`)",
          "anchor": "a-second-opt-in-completion-detection-mode-for-real-interactive-tuis-tsk-10j",
          "githubAnchor": "a-second-opt-in-completion-detection-mode-for-real-interactive-tuis-tsk-10j",
          "stableAnchor": "h-96c0351cf5de"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Flipping the default from headless to interactive (`tsk-4zi`)",
          "anchor": "flipping-the-default-from-headless-to-interactive-tsk-4zi",
          "githubAnchor": "flipping-the-default-from-headless-to-interactive-tsk-4zi",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6454eebd10a6"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The default flip immediately exposed a silent false-success bug (`tsk-2rr`)",
          "anchor": "the-default-flip-immediately-exposed-a-silent-false-success-bug-tsk-2rr",
          "githubAnchor": "the-default-flip-immediately-exposed-a-silent-false-success-bug-tsk-2rr",
          "stableAnchor": "h-14dcf90adccf"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A second, separate bug found in the same window: multi-line prompts corrupt `pane run`'s typed command line (`tsk-5cr`)",
          "anchor": "a-second-separate-bug-found-in-the-same-window-multi-line-prompts-corrupt-pane-runs-typed-command-line-tsk-5cr",
          "githubAnchor": "a-second-separate-bug-found-in-the-same-window-multi-line-prompts-corrupt-pane-runs-typed-command-line-tsk-5cr",
          "stableAnchor": "h-24cd07ee97f9"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "CHANGELOG entry landed (`tsk-r81`)",
          "anchor": "changelog-entry-landed-tsk-r81",
          "githubAnchor": "changelog-entry-landed-tsk-r81",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b4d1794efdd9"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Removing the non-interactive paths outright: herdr's only job is real TTY visibility (`tsk-by0`)",
          "anchor": "removing-the-non-interactive-paths-outright-herdrs-only-job-is-real-tty-visibility-tsk-by0",
          "githubAnchor": "removing-the-non-interactive-paths-outright-herdrs-only-job-is-real-tty-visibility-tsk-by0",
          "stableAnchor": "h-7dbb086d80b7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The adapter stops reading the terminal as evidence (dispatch visibility V0, Phase 02)",
          "anchor": "the-adapter-stops-reading-the-terminal-as-evidence-dispatch-visibility-v0-phase-02",
          "githubAnchor": "the-adapter-stops-reading-the-terminal-as-evidence-dispatch-visibility-v0-phase-02",
