          "githubAnchor": "what-shipped-scoped-narrowly-to-merge-loop-only",
          "stableAnchor": "h-27f7bf2d5038"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A named, deliberately unfixed risk across the whole `*-loop` family",
          "anchor": "a-named-deliberately-unfixed-risk-across-the-whole--loop-family",
          "githubAnchor": "a-named-deliberately-unfixed-risk-across-the-whole--loop-family",
