          "level": 1,
          "text": "A CAS check that couldn't tell \"I changed this myself\" from \"someone else changed this\"",
          "anchor": "a-cas-check-that-couldnt-tell-i-changed-this-myself-from-someone-else-changed-this",
          "githubAnchor": "a-cas-check-that-couldnt-tell-i-changed-this-myself-from-someone-else-changed-this",
          "stableAnchor": "h-93f71391ec24"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The gap: `fgos edit` never refreshes the snapshot it invalidates",
          "anchor": "the-gap-fgos-edit-never-refreshes-the-snapshot-it-invalidates",
          "githubAnchor": "the-gap-fgos-edit-never-refreshes-the-snapshot-it-invalidates",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8f36501382db"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Confirmed live, reproduced deterministically, twice",
