          "text": "A recursive footnote",
          "anchor": "a-recursive-footnote",
          "githubAnchor": "a-recursive-footnote",
          "stableAnchor": "h-827ed35c4e69"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The scope was wider than just `return` (`tsk-1ht`'s own live repro)",
          "anchor": "the-scope-was-wider-than-just-return-tsk-1hts-own-live-repro",
          "githubAnchor": "the-scope-was-wider-than-just-return-tsk-1hts-own-live-repro",
          "stableAnchor": "h-baaa4d3bf38d"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A second, distinct way the same helper fails closed: missing `payload.writer` (`tsk-1sr`)",
